{
  "info": {
    "name": "auth (base-stack)",
    "description": "Coleção pra testar os endpoints do serviço services/auth. Sobe o serviço primeiro (ver README.md: docker build + docker compose up), depois corre os pedidos em ordem -- Register/Login guardam access_token/refresh_token automaticamente em variáveis da coleção, usados pelos pedidos seguintes.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:8081" },
    { "key": "test_email", "value": "" },
    { "key": "test_password", "value": "senha-super-forte" },
    { "key": "access_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "refresh_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "api_key_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "api_key", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /healthz",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/healthz"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /readyz",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/readyz"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /.well-known/jwks.json",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/.well-known/jwks.json"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /v1/register",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('test_email', `user_${Date.now()}@example.test`);"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/register",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{test_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{test_password}}\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /v1/login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', body.access_token);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', body.refresh_token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/login",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{test_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{test_password}}\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /v1/token/refresh",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', body.access_token);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', body.refresh_token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/token/refresh",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refresh_token\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}"
            }
          },
          "description": "Roda o refresh token: o usado aqui fica inválido, o novo substitui a variável refresh_token. Reapresentar o antigo depois disto deve dar 401 (deteção de reuso)."
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /v1/logout",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 204', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/logout",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refresh_token\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "API Keys",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /v1/api-keys",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('api_key_id', body.id);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('api_key', body.key);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/api-keys",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"scopes\": [\"read:x\", \"write:x\"],\n  \"ttl_seconds\": 3600\n}"
            }
          },
          "description": "Exige um access_token válido (ver POST /v1/login). \"key\" só vem nesta resposta -- guarda-o, não dá pra recuperar depois."
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /v1/api-keys/introspect",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('active true', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().active).to.eql(true));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/api-keys/introspect",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"key\": \"{{api_key}}\"\n}"
            }
          },
          "description": "Chamado normalmente por OUTRO serviço, não pelo dono da chave -- não exige Authorization."
        },
        {
          "name": "DELETE /v1/api-keys/:id",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 204', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/api-keys/{{api_key_id}}"
          },
          "description": "Só o dono (mesmo access_token de quem criou) consegue revogar -- outro utilizador recebe 404."
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /v1/api-keys/introspect (depois de revogar)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('active false', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().active).to.eql(false));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/api-keys/introspect",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"key\": \"{{api_key}}\"\n}"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "OAuth (login social)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /v1/oauth/google/start",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/oauth/google/start"
          },
          "description": "302 redirecionando pro Google, com cookie oauth_state -- só funciona se AUTH_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID/SECRET/REDIRECT_URL estiverem configurados no serviço. Desative 'Automatically follow redirects' nas Settings do Postman se quiser ver o redirect em vez de segui-lo. Sem provider configurado, dá 404."
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /v1/oauth/github/start",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/v1/oauth/github/start"
          },
          "description": "Mesma coisa que o do Google, com AUTH_GITHUB_*."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
